  "description": "IGUJOM crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H92 Dy4 N16 O16,4(C2 H6 O1),4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1I (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1K (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.873-3.873 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 110.03-113.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C88H124Dy4N16O24.",
